Spec: Explicit secure direct Agent host

Purpose:
  Run an owner-configured secure direct listener and process-pinned local SDK endpoint without installation.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Agent.Console.csproj
  ./Program.cs

References:
  ../LinkGate.Broker/SecureConnections.sdd
  ../LinkGate.Broker/SecurePeerServer.sdd

Must:
  Compose real authority, dynamic visitor runtimes and approved publishers only in explicit authenticated serve mode; do not migrate installed configuration.
  Load private identity and state from explicit paths and print only public readiness references.
  Preserve the bounded legacy preview invocation; authenticated serve mode requires explicit confirmed settings and runs until owner stop/cancellation, with redirected EOF alone not stopping the host.
  Keep credentials out of standard output and never change installed runtime, routes, certificates or firewall policy.
